   - Clean up `.tmp-check-size-chip-bug.mjs` from the project root once the investigation concludes.
   - Marcel's own stated next step from earlier in the session ("fix the 3 gaps, test, then i'll test on my end, once all good we commit") — the "i'll test on my end" and "once all good we commit" phases have NOT yet happened; no commit has been made or requested. This size-chip-disabled bug may need to be resolved/folded in before Marcel's own testing pass, given it's a real, confirmed defect in the exact same PLP surface just worked on.

