    // stays fluid (width: 100%); this is Storybook-canvas-only sizing, not a production style,
    // so a raw px value here is fine (*.stories.tsx is outside auditTokenUsage.mjs's scanned
    // scope). Must be `width`, not `maxWidth`: with only `maxWidth` set, this Box can resolve to
    // its own shrink-to-fit/min-content size instead of stretching, leaving the component's
    // purely percentage-based sizing chain (root -> scrollContainer -> slide, deliberately fluid
